MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2220f057af6e84f46b4697fbe8e147af, type: 3}
  m_Name: JobOrder_COC1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CircuitCrafter.Guidance.JobOrderData
  jobNumber: JO-COC1-001
  moduleId: COC1
  unitTitle: Install and configure computer systems
  customerName: Ms. Reyes
  customerDetail: Office manager, Reyes Printing Services
  request: Our office PC needs a full check-up and a clean install. Please take it
    apart, check the parts, put it back together, and set it up for work.
  problem: The PC has become slow and unstable. We want a fresh system with the right
    drivers and our office software.
  expectedOutcomes:
  - System unit disassembled and reassembled, every part seated and every cable connected
  - Bootable Windows installer created on the USB flash drive
  - Windows installed on a correctly prepared partition
  - Drivers (chipset first), application software and updates installed
  - System tested and the service report completed
  specifications:
  - 'Operating system: the Windows installer image listed in the USB creator'
  - 'Installer media: USB flash drive'
  whatYouWillPractise: Safe disassembly and assembly of a system unit, preparing
    installation media, and installing and configuring the operating system.
  toolsNeeded:
  - Anti-static wrist strap
  - Phillips screwdriver
  - Parts tray
  - USB flash drive (8 GB or larger)
  safetyReminder: Unplug the PC before opening it, and wear an anti-static wrist
    strap clipped to the chassis.
  assessmentTitle: COC 1 Assessment - Install and Configure Computer Systems
  assessmentScenario: A client's desktop computer must be disassembled, reassembled,
    and made ready for use with a fresh operating system.
  assessmentOutcomes:
  - Disassemble and reassemble the system unit.
  - Prepare the installation media.
  - Install and configure the operating system, drivers, application software and
    updates.
  - Test the system and complete the service report.
  timeLimitMinutes: 0
